ll,"text":"（三）第7段：天空現象","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[30].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哪些句子最能幫你說出「天空現象可以提示天氣變化」？請先選兩個。","n":31,"ssz":"...1.........................1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[30].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"所謂「暈」就是圍繞著太陽或月亮的光環。","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[30].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看到日暈，可能夜裡會下雨，看到月暈，隔天白天可能會起風。","n":28,"ssz":"................1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[30].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"高空有層很薄的冰晶雲，把光折射開來，我們才會看到日暈或月暈。","n":30,"ssz":"............................1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[30].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"星星或遠山變得清楚，通常預示天氣即將轉晴或變涼。","n":24,"ssz":"......1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[32].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"日暈和月暈是高空冰晶雲折射光線形成的自然現象。","n":23,"ssz":"..1.1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[32].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"日暈、月暈和天空清晰度，都可能透露天氣變化。","n":22,"ssz":"....11................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[33].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四、我的發現與自我檢核","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[34].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.我的發現：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[35].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"做完上面的練習後，請選出「自我提問策略」的功能：(單選)","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[35].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"問「這段主要在說什麼？」只是幫我找出段落裡出現最多次的詞。","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[35].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"問「這段主要在說什麼？」可以幫我把重要細節整理成段落重點。","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[36].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.自我檢核","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[36].i